title: "opencode-muse-auth"
version: 0.5.1
date-released: "2026-10-30"
url: "https://github.com/TheStreamCode/opencode-muse-auth"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TheStreamCode/opencode-muse-auth"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Unofficial opencode plugin that registers the Muse Code subscription login
  method for the built-in meta provider, minting an account-bound inference key
  through a Meta device-code flow and keeping the OAuth token out of disk.
